          "description": "From athletes to aviators, scientists to spies. From the deep blue sea to the dark, black skies. Australia is full of girls who dare to do things differently. Adventurous girls. Brave women. Trailblazing women. Girls with guts and spirit.\n\nYou know what they are? They're FIERCE.\n\nAnd these are their stories. Perfect for all kids 6-12.",
